Sval: a Peek shows the downloads button only while it has downloads

A Peek lists only the downloads its own page started
(SvalDownloadWorkspaces), and Sval keeps the button in an ordinary
window's toolbar before the first download (browser.download.autohideButton
off). A Peek with none would show an empty button, so a Peek autohides it
whatever the pref says. No chrome API reaches this: DownloadsButton reads
the pref itself in hide and checkForAutoHide.

